model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "Adopted scenarios declare their exact fixtures, applicability and CI groups beside each test. Preparation and source verification derive the same typed overlay, and coverage rejects missing plans, drift and scheduled targets without a runner. Input patterns must match frozen source or carried targets, including supported unified patches. Undeclared executable inputs and shared E2E helpers select the full suite and all declaration matrices; area heuristics cannot establish coverage. Approved-mock checks accept a computed selector only when shell double quotes execute the verified declaration command."
    }
  }
}
